The bundled scalar codec is the inference subset of HeartCodec used by the
released SpanSynth checkpoint. HeartMuLa/HeartCodec code and weights are
licensed under Apache-2.0. The scalar encoder and decoder are redistributed
with their configuration, without the music language model or diffusion decoder.
https://github.com/HeartMuLa/heartlib

Modifications in this distribution remove training and evaluation paths,
retain the V8 inference model, and add a standalone CLI and checkpoint export.
